@startuml
title 4번 슬라이드. 현재 Gateway의 복원력 전략은 timeout + fallback + degrade 중심이다

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  FontColor #0F172A
  RoundCorner 18
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #93C5FD
  FontColor #1E3A8A
}

top to bottom direction

rectangle "WebClientAutoConfiguration\nconnect/read/write timeout 설정" as WebClientConfig #DBEAFE
rectangle "SearchClickRelayService\n500ms timeout + best effort" as ClickRelay #DCFCE7
rectangle "CatalogBffService\nonErrorResume + degrade fallback" as CatalogBff #FEF3C7
rectangle "CatalogDetailBffService\nfallbackToNormal / fallbackToSellerItemDetail" as CatalogDetail #FDE68A
rectangle "BusinessProductMediaBffService\nonErrorResume / onErrorReturn fallback" as ProductMediaBff #F8FAFC
rectangle "libs/config/resilience\n공통 CircuitBreaker 모듈은 존재" as ResilienceModule #F8FAFC

WebClientConfig --> ClickRelay
WebClientConfig --> CatalogBff
WebClientConfig --> CatalogDetail
WebClientConfig --> ProductMediaBff
ResilienceModule ..> CatalogBff
ResilienceModule ..> ProductMediaBff

note bottom of CatalogBff
코드 기준 현재 gateway는
명시적 CircuitBreakerHelper 호출보다
timeout, onErrorResume, degrade fallback 패턴을 더 적극적으로 사용한다.
end note

note bottom of ClickRelay
실패해도 사용자 흐름을 막지 않는
best effort 호출은 짧은 timeout 후
조용히 비워 버리는 전략을 쓴다.
end note

@enduml
